    {
      "id": "story-frame-11",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 900,
      "name": "Slide 11",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#202020",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 111,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1987432140,
      "customData": {
        "title": "Problems I fixed while building",
        "spoken": "Some of the hardest problems had nothing to do with artificial intelligence. One was the camera. If the two apps cropped someone's face differently, the comparison became less reliable. I changed them to use the same cropping rules. Another problem was ticket claims. If the server received a request but the phone missed the reply, pressing again could create a second request. I made retries use the same request number. Finally, I made the gate save that a ticket had been used before showing the success screen. Otherwise, an app crash could leave a ticket able to be reused. These changes taught me to think about what happens when things go wrong halfway through.",
        "keyPoints": "1. Use matching camera-crop rules.\n2. Make a retry safe if a reply gets lost.\n3. Save ticket use before showing success.",
        "originalSlideText": "ENGINEERING\nThe hardest bugs were not about AI.\nThree changes made the whole process more reliable.\nPrivate Pass  /  MANAV CODATY\n11\n01\nCAMERA CROPPING\nDifferent crops give different face inputs.\nFIX\nUse the same crop rules in both apps.\n02\nREPEATED CLAIMS\nA failed response can lead to a second request.\nFIX\nReuse the same request ID on retry.\n03\nRECORD BEFORE SUCCESS\nThe app could stop before saving entry.\nFIX\nSave the used ticket before showing success.",
        "sources": [
          "/Users/manavcodaty/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Praco Family/EPQ/Mav/PrivatePass_EPQ Presentation_v4.pptx — slide 11"
        ],
        "claim": "Problems I fixed while building"
      },
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793174454816,
      "link": null
    },
