    {
      "id": "story-frame-15",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 3150,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 900,
      "name": "Slide 15",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#202020",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 115,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1369189068,
      "customData": {
        "title": "Did I meet my goals?",
        "spoken": "I went back to my four goals to judge the project fairly. The software checks support the offline gate idea, although the full phone journey wasn't saved as a detailed final test. The saved tests also support stopping a ticket from being used twice. The system was designed so the server doesn't keep reusable face information, but I didn't carry out an independent security review. The biggest gap is face performance. I can't give reliable figures for accuracy or protection against fake faces. So I built a useful prototype, but not something I'd call ready for public use.",
        "keyPoints": "1. Offline checks partly evidenced.\n2. Replay protection supported by tests.\n3. Privacy supported by design; face performance not proved.",
        "originalSlideText": "EVALUATION\nDid Private Pass meet its goals?\nPrivate Pass  /  MANAV CODATY\n14\nOffline gate decisions\nSoftware checks supported; full phone route later observed.\nPARTIAL\nStop ticket reuse\nRepeated-use handling backed by tests.\nSUPPORTED\nLimit central face storage\nArchitecture avoids reusable central face records.\nBY DESIGN\nProven face performance\nNo full accuracy, spoof or fairness dataset.\nNOT PROVEN\nA WORKING PROTOTYPE IS NOT YET A TESTED COMMERCIAL PRODUCT",
        "sources": [
          "/Users/manavcodaty/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Praco Family/EPQ/Mav/PrivatePass_EPQ Presentation_v4.pptx — slide 15"
        ],
        "claim": "Did I meet my goals?"
      },
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793174454816,
      "link": null
    },
